<p>Hi <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone asked to reset the password for your Finance Tracker account. You can choose a new one with the link below:</p>

<p><%= link_to "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email — your password won't change until you open the link and pick a new one.</p>
